  {
    "id": "3163333989",
    "isSimulated": false,
    "title": "Dawn Of Humanity [4K]",
    "description": "After 6 months of hiatus I am finally back with another wallpaper! It's been such a long time!\n\nAnyway, just to give a quick summary as to what happened over the past 6 months, I entered the military for my basic military training (BMT) on Aug 11th last year, and I finished my BMT on Dec 3rd. If you are wondering why it took me so long to upload another live wallpaper even though I finished my BMT, its because the military unit that I went into is uh... let's just say is really tough and mentally straining on me. I will just say that not a lot of people had the chance to rappel off a helicopter that is hovering around the height of a 8 storey building (Just saying I actually haven't rappel off a helicopter yet, I was suppose to but it was raining on that day so the conduct was cancelled. But I did rappel off a 8 storey building to simulate the actual thing so yeah).\n\nAs you can see, I am probably even busier than I was back in BMT, so any free time that I have at home is not spent on animating wallpapers but on playing games and sleeping. This is the reason why I was inactive for so long, and if you are wondering, yes it means that I will be extremely sporadic in my uploads for live wallpapers for the foreseeable future, considering that I have to be in the military until Aug 2025. I apologise if you are disappointed that you cannot see more wallpapers from me, but this is the best I can do for now. In fact, this wallpaper probably took me more than a month to actually finish it due to the lack of time I had, so expect 2-3 wallpapers per year lol.\n\nRegardless, I hope you enjoy this wallpaper!\n\nMusic:\n\n[url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RsAg_osD1GE] AK - Sunrays [/url]\n\nOriginal wallpaper can be found [url=https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/112548853] here [/url] (From Uomi)\n\nUpdate 1: Fix issue of audio bar line not disappearing if audio bars is disabled\n\nUpdate 2: Added Media Integration and the option to disable it. Also added the ability for the wallpaper to stop playing its integrated music if music is also being played from another source e.g Youtube or Soundcloud etc. (Thanks Gariam for this script lol)\n\nUpdate 3: Adjusted pulse effect\n\nUpdate 4: Adjusted the date function so that days are not abbreviated\n\nUpdate 5: Added gradient blend effect for the album cover so that it can transition smoothly to the next cover\n\nUpdate 6: Adjusted date function again so that days are not shown (sorry for this but for some reason the position of the date text will move depending on what day it is today)\n\nUpdate 7: Changed the Album layer so that it shows the previous album cover\n\nUpdate 8: Fixed issue of packaged wallpaper music not playing once an external audio source has finished playing (Thank you Gariam for fixing this!)\n\nUpdate 9: Slightly changed the spawn position of the light beam particle so that it lines up better with the light beam\n\nUpdate 10: Optimised the wallpaper slightly\n\nUpdate 11: Adjusted spawn position of bokeh particles\n\nUpdate 12: Adjusted bass pulse to make it more obvious\n\nUpdate 13: removed decimals for bar count\n\nUpdate 14: Edited pulse\n\nUpdate 15: Fixed issue of birds despawning too soon",
